{"id":"corriente","lemma":"corriente","pos":"adj","rank":1452,"glosses":["flowing, running","current (existing or occurring at the moment)","common, usual"],"ipa":"/koˈrjente/","forms":{"femininePlural":"corrientes"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/2f/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-corriente.wav","examples":[{"text":"Me gustaría abrir una cuenta corriente.","en":"I'd like to open a checking account.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/702907","words":[{"g":"me"},{"g":"to like in a general…","l":"gustar"},{"g":"to open, open up"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"count, tally"},null]},{"text":"Estamos al corriente de eso.","en":"We're aware of that.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/455263","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"to the"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"that","l":"ése"}]},{"text":"Son gente corriente.","en":"They're normal people.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/221599","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"people"},null]},{"text":"Toda la ciudad está al corriente.","en":"The whole town knows about it.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/610746","words":[{"g":"all","l":"todo"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"city"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"to the"},null]},{"text":"No hay agua corriente.","en":"There's no running water.","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"water"},null]}]}